# Both Dockerfiles install dependencies in the image and then `COPY . .`. Without
# this file that copy would carry the host's node_modules (macOS binaries over
# the Linux ones just installed) and — worse — a local .env, baking real API
# keys into an image layer that anyone who can pull the image can read.

# Secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
apps/worker/eval/models.json

# Installed or built on the host; the image makes its own
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
coverage

# Not needed to build or run
.git
.claude
**/.DS_Store
